{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an apocalyptic world overrun by demons, play as a young hero summoned by a mysterious ritual in a desperate attempt to restore balance. Battle terrifying creatures that lurk in the dark with the help of your canine companion. Build a home base in hell for some new and unusual friends you meet along the way. Grow your resistance, and take the fight to those who let the world fall to corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/96522203868504b60185040bf22e986b.poster.avif?t=1771460261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/96522203868504b60185040bf22e986b.webm?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/96522203868504b60185040bf22e986b.mp4?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Fast-Paced, Varied Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm up with a varied arsenal of guns, crossbow arrows, melee weapons, and defensive gadgets  to complete story-driven and procedural runs full of hellish hordes. Gather loot and level up your character along the way...if you can make it back to home base.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddf5 A Mysterious Narrative to Unravel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nature of the world is the nature of yourself. Learn the truth behind this world\u2019s downfall, and shed light on the hidden forces that conspired to bring it about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/70edc9b77cf4ef3d07cf1e3c7d06663a.poster.avif?t=1771460261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/70edc9b77cf4ef3d07cf1e3c7d06663a.webm?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/70edc9b77cf4ef3d07cf1e3c7d06663a.mp4?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf18 A Dark World to Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a land torn apart by decades of demonic onslaught and held under the thumb of an oppressive religious regime bent on ensuring order...at all costs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd28 A Fractured Resistance to Rebuild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a loyal dog and allies you meet along your journey to put together the pieces of a splintered resistance movement.\u00a0Upgrade a home base in the far reaches of hell, providing a place to shop, garden, fish, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/9c7d336827c2043918ae872198b77e15.poster.avif?t=1771460261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/9c7d336827c2043918ae872198b77e15.webm?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/9c7d336827c2043918ae872198b77e15.mp4?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcfa Analog-Era Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time seemed to freeze when the demons arrived. Let the minimalist pixel art and lo-fi soundtrack transport you to an era of clicking tape decks, whirring disk drives, and glowing CRT screens.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012520?t=1771460261","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/feb06b2127e3cb8bdb55c3325812756e61bc0679/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771460261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/ff77200c6f73ef6a877059d9c7679f90b1954aaf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771460261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/ff77200c6f73ef6a877059d9c7679f90b1954aaf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771460261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an apocalyptic world overrun by demons, play as a young hero summoned by a mysterious ritual in a desperate attempt to restore balance. Battle terrifying creatures that lurk in the dark with the help of your canine companion. Build a home base in hell for some new and unusual friends you meet along the way. Grow your resistance, and take the fight to those who let the world fall to corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/96522203868504b60185040bf22e986b.poster.avif?t=1771460261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/96522203868504b60185040bf22e986b.webm?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/96522203868504b60185040bf22e986b.mp4?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Fast-Paced, Varied Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm up with a varied arsenal of guns, crossbow arrows, melee weapons, and defensive gadgets  to complete story-driven and procedural runs full of hellish hordes. Gather loot and level up your character along the way...if you can make it back to home base.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddf5 A Mysterious Narrative to Unravel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nature of the world is the nature of yourself. Learn the truth behind this world\u2019s downfall, and shed light on the hidden forces that conspired to bring it about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/70edc9b77cf4ef3d07cf1e3c7d06663a.poster.avif?t=1771460261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/70edc9b77cf4ef3d07cf1e3c7d06663a.webm?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/70edc9b77cf4ef3d07cf1e3c7d06663a.mp4?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf18 A Dark World to Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a land torn apart by decades of demonic onslaught and held under the thumb of an oppressive religious regime bent on ensuring order...at all costs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd28 A Fractured Resistance to Rebuild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a loyal dog and allies you meet along your journey to put together the pieces of a splintered resistance movement.\u00a0Upgrade a home base in the far reaches of hell, providing a place to shop, garden, fish, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/9c7d336827c2043918ae872198b77e15.poster.avif?t=1771460261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/9c7d336827c2043918ae872198b77e15.webm?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/extras/9c7d336827c2043918ae872198b77e15.mp4?t=1771460261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcfa Analog-Era Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time seemed to freeze when the demons arrived. Let the minimalist pixel art and lo-fi soundtrack transport you to an era of clicking tape decks, whirring disk drives, and glowing CRT screens.</p>","developers":["Normal Horse Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012520/35cff503211383db32b162ceefb90b201d720d60/header.jpg?t=1771460261","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU supporting Metal<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / Apple Silicon M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-compatible GPU (de